  "prefLabel": "Plc 908.03 Reinstatement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 908.03 Reinstatement. Any individual whose license has been revoked or whose application for license renewal was denied pursuant to Plc 908.02 who wishes to have the license reinstated shall do so in accordance with Plc 312.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
